name fitbox
category Package
revision 50088
shortdesc Fit graphics on a page
relocated 1
longdesc The package allows a box (usually an \includegraphics box) to
longdesc fit on the page. It scales the box to the maximal allowed size
longdesc within the user-set limits. If there is not enough space on the
longdesc page, the box is moved to the next one.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/fitbox/fitbox.sty
